export class StepClock{
 constructor(){this.clear();}
 clear(){this.key='';this.elapsed=0;this.charged=false;}
 tick(dt,{key='',paused=false}={}){if(key!==this.key){this.key=key;this.elapsed=0;this.charged=false;}if(!key||paused||this.charged||!Number.isFinite(dt)||dt<=0)return false;this.elapsed=Math.min(ACTION_SECONDS,this.elapsed+Math.min(dt,.1));if(this.elapsed+1e-7<ACTION_SECONDS)return false;this.charged=true;return true;}
 get remaining(){return Math.max(0,Math.ceil(ACTION_SECONDS-this.elapsed));}
}
